hyperwhisper (1.15.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Pick your microphone in Settings > Sound, and optionally muffle other
    audio while recording.
  * The CUDA backends now ship as a separate hyperwhisper-cuda package,
    so the main package is much smaller.
  * Add ElevenLabs Scribe v2 Medical and Mistral Medium 3.5, refresh the
    model catalog, and move retired models to their replacements.
  * Local Whisper no longer repeats a phrase at the end of long
    dictations, and a silent recording reads No speech.
  * Faster startup and History, and Stop no longer waits two seconds.
  * More reliable shortcuts on X11 and evdev, clipboard restore, live
    streaming, tray menu, and quitting with SIGTERM.
  * API keys of any shape are accepted, and a typed key is kept when
    saving it fails.
  * Backup and vocabulary fixes: clearer errors, no duplicate words,
    and exports readable only by you.

 -- HyperWhisper Contributors <opensource@hyperwhisper.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 04:21:35 +0000

hyperwhisper (1.14.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add AssemblyAI Dictation, which returns cleaned-up text with your
    vocabulary in 32 languages.
  * Grok Voice Transcribe 2 is now the default Grok model, with Grok
    Voice Transcribe 1 still selectable.
  * The mode editor's Provider list shows one row per company, and the
    Model list no longer goes blank.
  * Require a modifier key when recording a global shortcut.
  * Fix error messages being cut off, the onboarding test-dictation
    status, and the Local API port setting.

 -- HyperWhisper Contributors <opensource@hyperwhisper.com>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 11:09:50 +0000

hyperwhisper (1.13.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix no microphone being offered on a fresh install, and the audio
    input picker going blank after a transcription.
  * Stop the app closing when the Cloud Model list is opened under the
    API key transcription source.
  * Fix a crash when an audio device is added or removed.
  * Stop offering speaker monitors as microphones.
  * Local API: report the transcription model that actually ran, and
    apply the text replacement and formatting passes.
  * Refresh the transcription and language model catalog, and keep a long
    mode name inside the status bar, the History badge and the menus.

 -- HyperWhisper Contributors <opensource@hyperwhisper.com>  Wed, 16 Sep 2026 03:03:57 +0000

hyperwhisper (1.12.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild the Linux onboarding and app UI on the Windows design, and fix
    the onboarding overlay getting stuck.
  * Add Microsoft MAI-Transcribe-2 and Meta Muse Voice Transcribe as
    HyperWhisper Cloud transcription options.
  * Improve live-dictation accuracy with a shared word-agreement engine.
  * Fix HyperWhisper Cloud transcription retries running past the
    expected wait time, and /health reporting a failing provider as healthy.

 -- HyperWhisper Contributors <opensource@hyperwhisper.com>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 03:43:35 +0000

hyperwhisper (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add Gemini 3.5 Transcribe for recordings and live dictation, with
    bring-your-own-key and a HyperWhisper Cloud live tier picker.
  * Retire the Chirp 3 cloud tier; existing Modes move across on their own.
  * Add Gemma 4 12B to the local language model catalog.
  * Remove a license key offline, without a server round-trip.
  * Fix live billing, backup restore, and live-only Mode handling.

